Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.34,0:01:30.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}反正都会赢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.22,0:01:32.94,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}你看见了吗 那就享受吧
